## Careful: Your Opinion isn't Evidence

It's tempting to name something as "clear" or "obvious" when it appears that way to us. Often these claims seem self-evidence from our personal experiences or knowledge. However, something that's obvious to you may not be to your reader; that's why evidence is important.

